        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>WdtSendTest</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Send the WDT test command to the RPU. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Mirrors the Linux visp_mbox_wdt_send_test() flow, but uses the bare-metal mailbox Send_Command() path (same format as SetATM / INIT_FIRMWARE). The payload carries the instance id followed by the number of seconds the RPU should keep petting its WWDT before deliberately stopping, which lets the APU-side notifier observe the resulting WWDT0 expiry.</para><para><simplesect kind="return"><para>RET_SUCCESS on success, error code otherwise. </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
